WEBVTT

00:00:00.272 --> 00:00:00.464
Yes,

00:00:01.874 --> 00:00:02.467
I'm still here.

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:04.871
The old change is mine.

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:08.636
The comment says: Only temporary.

00:00:09.069 --> 00:00:10.479
That was four years ago.

00:00:11.312 --> 00:00:14.244
Back then, all requests came
from one place.

00:00:14.757 --> 00:00:18.554
The program now tries three times at
each of three different places.

00:00:19.484 --> 00:00:22.736
Good, the new automatic
retries are off now.

00:00:23.169 --> 00:00:24.739
The queue is getting shorter.

00:00:25.172 --> 00:00:27.383
We still need to prevent duplicate jobs.

00:00:27.913 --> 00:00:29.555
But not rushed tonight.

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:31.326
The first report is ready.

00:00:31.761 --> 00:00:33.339
The others are arriving now too.

00:00:34.031 --> 00:00:35.351
All with the same chart.

00:00:35.883 --> 00:00:38.008
At least we agree on the numbers.

00:00:38.539 --> 00:00:42.194
Five minutes of work turned into eleven
pages of error analysis.

00:00:42.871 --> 00:00:44.996
The change is still six lines.

